Package: MARS
Type: Package
Title: Second-Order Reduction for Sparse Precision Matrices
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Qian", "Li", email = "qianxa.li@connect.polyu.hk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Binyan", "Jiang", email = "by.jiang@polyu.edu.hk", role = "aut"),
    person("Defeng", "Sun", email = "defeng.sun@polyu.edu.hk", role = "aut"))
Description: Generates a solution path of sparse precision matrices under the
    l1-penalized D-trace loss with an adaptive sieving reduction strategy and
    a semismooth Newton augmented Lagrangian algorithm (MARS), designed for
    the high-dimensional setting where the sample dimension p is much greater
    than the sample size n.
License: GPL-2
URL: https://github.com/QianLI-QL/MARS
BugReports: https://github.com/QianLI-QL/MARS/issues
Depends: Matrix
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
